commit d7d2272c409fce659855a7970b9c3c730bb11e94

C03: a research order that carries a question is the public search for that question in the person's words, and a conversational lead-in supplies its subject (WEB1831)

The mind reads «…, puedes investigar en internet porqué suele fallar», «Investigá en internet por qué falla WhatsApp» and «Search the internet for why WhatsApp keeps failing» as web.search with the question as the query (a who/what question keeps its subject lookup); when the question names no subject, the statement before the request («me falla mucho whatsapp») is prepended; the resolver, the authoritative gate and the argument binding use the same reader.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


